# EDA on Retail Sales Data

## Project Overview
This project focuses on Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) of retail sales data as part of the Oasis Infobyte Data Analytics Internship.

## Objectives
- Understand the retail sales dataset.
- Clean and prepare the data.
- Explore sales patterns and trends.
- Create visualizations to understand the data.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Jupyter Notebook

